| `tests/integration/test_change_comment_gate.py` | Fails a comment that opens a thought with a configured change phrase as a whole word (`# now uses X`), because the commit message carries the change and the comment owes the reason. | `make test` | [`change_comments.phrases`](settings.md#configprojectjson) | A heuristic: it cannot see a phrase in mid-sentence or a change reported in other words. | [python-style.md](../guides/python-style.md) | always |
